tified operators. Confirm harness and dual-brake systems, helmet and stated weight limits before booking with Selvatura, Sky Adventures or 100% Aventura — high-speed lines and Superman/Tarzan configurations raise the stakes.","source":"selvatura.com, 2026-07-06","si_tag":"safety"},{"q":"How hard is the drive to Monteverde?","a":"It''s a real mountain climb. Monteverde sits at ~1,400 m, roughly 3–4 hours from Juan Santamaría (SJO), with the final stretch a rough, partly-unpaved and fog-prone road — drive in daylight, 4WD recommended, allow extra time.","source":"https://www.gov.uk/foreign-travel-advice/costa-rica","si_tag":"safety"}],"seo":{"meta_title":"Monteverde Cloud Forest, Costa Rica: Quetzals, Ziplines & Cloud-Forest Lodges | TravelWell.World","meta_description":"Plan Monteverde - the original cloud-forest zipline, resplendent-quetzal birding, hanging bridges, night walks, and boutique eco-lodges. Best times, safety, and how to book.","search_language":"es-CR","local_keywords":["bosque nuboso Monteverde","canopy Monteverde","reserva Santa Elena","quetzal Monteverde temporada","puentes colgantes Monteverde","tour nocturno Monteverde","hoteles ecologicos Monteverde","como llegar a Monteverde"],"hreflang":["en","es-CR"],"jsonld_type":"TouristDestination","content_freshness":"2026-07-06","attribution":{"author":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World"},"publisher":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World LLC"},"reviewed_by":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World"},"digital_source_type":"CompositeWithTrainedAlgorithmicMediaDigitalSource","digital_source_vocab":"https://schema.org/IPTCDigitalSourceEnumeration","last_verified":"2026-07-06","last_verified_basis":"source_verified","verified_against":[{"name":"UK Foreign, Commonwealth & Development Office","url":"https://www.gov.uk/foreign-travel-advice/costa-rica","read":"2026-08-20T14:54:18Z","source_updated":"2026-05-19T11:42:25+01:00"}]},"long_tail":["Monteverde cloud forest guide 2026","best zipline in Monteverde","resplendent quetzal season Monteverde","Monteverde vs Santa Elena reserve","Monteverde hanging bridges","Monteverde night walk","luxury eco lodge Monteverde","how to get to Monteverde from San Jose","Monteverde honeymoon treehouse"]},"booking":{"advisory_updated":"2026-08-20","advisory_authority":"FCDO"},"si_checklist_25":null,"sis_present":["expedition","wildlife","romance"],"ultra":[{"name":"Hotel Belmar","type":"premier boutique eco-lodge","note":"CST level 5, first carbon-neutral in Monteverde, brewery, Nicoya Suites ~1000sqft, ~$270-1200/nt; Design Hotels + Mr&Mrs Smith listed; no confirmed Virtuoso","consortia":"Design Hotels / Mr & Mrs Smith / Fora","mor":"consortia commission or DMC block","tier":"premium-boutique (NOT ultra-palace)"},{"name":"Hidden Canopy Treehouses","type":"adults-only luxury treehouses","note":"R&H apex, secluded canopy","consortia":"consortia/DMC","mor":"consortia/DMC","tier":"premium-boutique"},{"name":"Senda Monteverde","type":"modern sustainable boutique","note":"private trails, farm-to-table","consortia":"consortia/DMC","mor":"consortia/DMC","tier":"premium-boutique"},{"name":"Koora Monteverde","type":"newest boutique eco-lodge","note":"26 rooms (10 suites/6 bungalows/10 forest)","consortia":"consortia/DMC","mor":"consortia/DMC","tier":"premium-boutique"}],"source_verified":"2026-07-06","hero":{"query":"Monteverde, Costa Rica"},"geo":{"lat":10.301,"lng":-84.8259},"orbit":[{"id":"guanacaste-costa-rica","jewels":10,"si":["tropical","expedition","liveaboard","wellness","wildlife"]},{"id":"la-fortuna-arenal-costa-rica","jewels":10,"si":["expedition","romance","wellness"]},{"id":"manuel-antonio-costa-rica","jewels":9,"si":["tropical","expedition","wildlife"]},{"id":"nosara-costa-rica","jewels":10,"si":["tropical","expedition","wellness"]},{"id":"osa-peninsula-corcovado-costa-rica","jewels":9,"si":["expedition","diveglobal"]},{"id":"puerto-viejo-costa-rica","jewels":10,"si":["tropical","expedition","culture","wild